%% UC-10 — Retrieve resolved habit config (cues + SRHI items)
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant F as Flutter App (My Habits tab)
    participant B as Backend (habitConfigService)
    participant M as MongoDB

    F->>B: GET /api/v1/me/habit-config (Bearer token)
    B->>M: findOne(enrollments, {userId})
    M-->>B: enrollment {studyId, groupId, cueConfig?}
    B->>M: findOne(studies) -> group.cueConfig (or public default)
    M-->>B: cueConfig {cueCount, cueSource, cuePoolId, behaviorOptions, maxHabits}
    alt cueSource = pre-rated pool
        B->>M: sample(cue_pools, {quality, domain, language})
        M-->>B: random pre-rated cues
    end
    B-->>F: {cueConfig, assignedCues, srhiItems[12], behaviorOptions}
